   "market": "FBM KLCI -8.88 pts (-0.55%) to 1,595.19, closing below 1,600 as selling in banks persisted, though breadth was positive (gainers 686 vs losers 427); turnover RM2.33bn (FMT/Bernama 11 Nov). Public Bank -3% to RM4.53 extending its slide on a guidance cut (KLSE Screener/The Edge 11 Nov). Midday wrap cited global inflation fears and caution ahead of results season (The Star via KLSE Screener 11 Nov).",
   "1066": "-2.0% to RM7.54 on 6.19m shares (vs 5.67m Tue): led bank-sector selling, named among the heaviest midday drags (The Star 11 Nov). No company-specific announcement found; 3Q results est. 26 Nov (Yahoo).",
