   "1961": "+2.3% to RM4.39: CPO futures snapped a six-day losing run, up ~3% to ~RM4,388/t on firmer soyoil and a smaller-than-expected MPOB stock build (Reuters via Business Recorder; FCPOfolio 11 Nov).",
